OL,3,GNEWSAAuthority seeks 'parity' over
OL,4,Ahistoric council debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council said its call for a formal
OL,7,Freview of historic debt inherited
OL,8,Fthrough local government reorganisation
OL,9,Fwas motivated by a duty to seek "parity
OL,10,Ffor our residents".
OL,12,FIn a letter to Secretary of State
OL,13,FAngela Rayner, West Northamptonshire
OL,14,FCouncil leader Mark Arnull asked the
OL,15,Fgovernment to write off "substantial
OL,16,Flegacy liabilities" from the
OL,17,Fauthorities replaced when the county's
OL,18,Fnew unitary councils were created in
OL,19,F2021.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
